{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>לאחרונה</b> — two times in the Masorah: לאחרונה יסעו. And they shall have no remembrance, since they travel last. For Amalek mutilated the tribe of Dan because of the sin of Micah's idol that was among them. יהיה להם זכרון — final letters: המן, who also sought to destroy their remembrance." "<b>(לז)</b> — They were not counted among the children of Israel. There are tagin on the heh to teach that in five places where Israel were counted, they were not counted among them."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:04.790775613Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}